text: ['Destroy target land.', "Destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'First strike; reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\\n{G}: Regenerate River Boa.", "Look at target player's hand and choose X cards from it. That player discards those cards.", 'Shock deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Volcanic Geyser deals X damage to any target.', 'When Staunch Defenders enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Prodigal Sorcerer deals 1 damage to any target.']
flavor: ['"But no one heard the snake\'s gentle hiss for peace over the elephant\'s trumpeting of war."\\n—Afari, *Tales*', '"Hold your position! Leave doubt for the dying!"\\n—Tahngarth of the *Weatherlight*', '"If it bears wings, I will pin it to the skies over Tefemburu."\\n—Roya, Zhalfirin archer', 'Lightning tethers souls to the world.\\n—Kor saying', 'My thunder comes before the lightning; my lightning comes before the clouds; my rain dries all the land it touches. What am I?\\n—Femeref riddle', 'The hardest of wizards can have the softest of minds.']
